# AI technical review (Claude Opus 5.5), no native-speaker signoff.
msgid "Scored 2026-10-17 on the 153 test fields of the curated 2026-10-15 dataset (spacr.plaque.segment_plaque_image, defaults): object F1 0.816 (95% bootstrap CI 0.778 to 0.848), v4 0.725, v3 0.741, stock cpsam_v2 0.227. On the 81 test fields neither v3 nor v4 saw: v5 0.803, v4 0.661, v3 0.684. AJI is level with v4 (0.737 against 0.744); Gel Doc wells 0.868 against v4 0.901 and v3 0.954."
